  "description": "Change of use from Building material storage (Use Class B8) to MOT Centre (Use Class B2); canopy attached to garage; raising roof height of existing garage; boundary treatment with shutter door access; bin stores; external alterations (Demolition of one existing detached garage)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;In the absence of a Transport assessment and a noise report\r\ninsufficient information has been submitted to the Local Planning Authority to\r\ndemonstrate that the proposed change of use to MOT centre &amp;nbsp;would not lead to adverse impacts on the\r\namenity of neighbouring residential properties and the Local Planning Authority\r\nis unable to assess whether the proposed change of use would impact on the\r\nparking and surrounding road network. The proposal would therefore fail to\r\naccord with policies GR1 and M2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and policy\r\nD14 and of The London Plan (2021).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
